# Implementation Plan: Web GUI Fixes (History & Layout)

## Goal
Resolve the issues reported by the user:
1. Analysis History not showing in the Web GUI (currently showing 0 records).
2. Layout not occupying the full width of the page.

## Proposed Changes

### 1. Layout Fix
#### [MODIFY] [App.css](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/Coding/QualiaQC/web-gui/src/App.css)
- Remove `max-width`, `margin: 0 auto`, `padding`, and `text-align: center` from `#root`.
- Set `width: 100%`.

#### [MODIFY] [index.css](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/Coding/QualiaQC/web-gui/src/index.css)
- Remove `display: flex` and `place-items: center` from `body` to disable global centering.

#### [MODIFY] [App.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/Coding/QualiaQC/web-gui/src/App.tsx)
