### 2. History & Persistence Fix
#### [MODIFY] [server.py](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/Coding/QualiaQC/src/server.py)
- Refactor `/api/history` to use individual try-except blocks for DB and legacy scanning.
- Ensure that if the DB query fails (due to schema mismatch in Docker), the endpoint still returns legacy results from `.gri` files.
- Improve logging to clearly identify if the failure is in the DB query or the legacy scan.

#### [MODIFY] [manager.py](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/Coding/QualiaQC/src/db/manager.py)
- Ensure [_migrate_schema](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/Coding/QualiaQC/src/db/manager.py#13-33) is robust and called at initialization to add missing columns if they aren't present.

### 3. Verification Plan
- Use `run_command` with `curl` or a python script to hit `/api/history` and verify the output.
- Check if the layout change resolves the narrow view.
